.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt PKCS12_ADD_FRIENDLYNAME_ASC 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm PKCS12_add_friendlyname_asc ,
.Nm PKCS12_add_friendlyname_utf8 ,
.Nm PKCS12_add_friendlyname_uni
.Nd Functions to add the friendlyname attribute to a PKCS#12 safeBag
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/pkcs12.h
.Ft int
.Fo PKCS12_add_friendlyname_asc
.Fa "PKCS12_SAFEBAG *bag"
.Fa "const char *name"
.Fa "int namelen"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo PKCS12_add_friendlyname_utf8
.Fa "PKCS12_SAFEBAG *bag"
.Fa "const char *name"
.Fa "int namelen"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo PKCS12_add_friendlyname_uni
.Fa "PKCS12_SAFEBAG *bag"
.Fa "const unsigned char *name"
.Fa "int namelen"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn PKCS12_add_friendlyname_asc
adds an ASCII string representation of the PKCS#9 friendlyName attribute
to a PKCS#12 safeBag.
.Pp
.Fn PKCS12_add_friendlyname_utf8
adds a UTF-8 string representation of the PKCS#9 friendlyName attribute
to a PKCS#12 safeBag.
.Pp
.Fn PKCS12_add_friendlyname_uni
adds a Unicode string representation of the PKCS#9 friendlyName
attribute to a PKCS#12 safeBag.
.Pp
.Fa bag
is the
.Vt PKCS12_SAFEBAG
to add the attribute to.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 1 for success or 0 for failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr PKCS12_get_friendlyname 3
